Inline Common Type Credits
	documentation 'Credits or units of value awarded for the completion of a course.
    shared decimal CreditsValue named Credits
        documentation 'The value of credits or units of value awarded for the completion of a course.
        is required
    enumeration CreditType
        documentation 'The type of credits or units of value awarded for the completion of a course.
        is optional
    decimal CreditConversion
        documentation 'Conversion factor that when multiplied by the number of credits is equivalent to 
        'Carnegie units.
        is optional
        total digits 9
        decimal places 2

